request: Rename Todo.done to Todo.completed everywhere.

governor turn 1: plan -> commands  (The only failure is in my own acceptance test. It required list() to hide completed todos by default, but the request is a pure field rename and never asked for that filtering. tsc is clean and all owner tests pass. I'm replacing the acceptance test with one that checks only the rename, so it doesn't push a behaviour change nobody asked for.)
round 1: owners commands=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 2: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 13/13 tests pass). The Todo type now declares `completed` and no longer has `done`, so tsc would reject any remaining typed use of `.done`. The acceptance test confirms that add/complete/list use `completed` and that no `done` key is present. ListOptions.includeDone was kept on purpose because the request was limited to the Todo field.)

